      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\n俺の思いがお前に伝わるって信じる。",
        "official_en": "Yeah, I’ll trust that what I’m saying will get through to you.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. I believe my feelings will get through to you."
      },
